{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Black Zen White</strong> is a 2D puzzle platformer where the world flips every 10 seconds between two versions \u2014 black and white \u2014 each with different platforms, walls, and possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your mind, your timing, and help from unusual seal-shaped inhabitants to solve puzzles, unlock time-bending abilities, and reach the exit. Every level is a moment of calm \u2014 and cleverness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf13 <strong>Two colors. One path.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jump, wait, land. What exists in black may vanish in white...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_005_-_act_at_the_right_time.gif?t=1747139308\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d <strong>One puzzle. Many helpers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Push friendly seals into place. Stack them, slide them, or give them a nudge \u2014 sometimes they help...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_010_-_get_help.gif?t=1747139308\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>One wall. Two realities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Walk through what\u2019s solid\u2026 or wait for it to disappear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_009_-_go_through_walls.gif?t=1747139308\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Stay calm. Solve smart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Zoom out, think through layers of shifting logic \u2014 black, then white, then black...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_011_-_black_then_white.gif?t=1747139308\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Patience is power. Bending time is power.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Slow down. Speed up. Master time itself to reach what was once unreachable.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_012_-_slow-motion.gif?t=1747139308\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 The end is always there. The path is always changing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>There\u2019s always a way \u2014 if you wait, watch, and move with purpose.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_007_-_find_your_way_out.gif?t=1747139308\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Black Zen White</strong> invites you into a meditative world of duality, lighthearted logic, and surprising discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f Wishlist now and discover the power of stillness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237030?t=1747139308","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237030?t=1747139308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/9c49b81396c42c4ce50dc8beb282d0ac9510e916/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747139308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/9c49b81396c42c4ce50dc8beb282d0ac9510e916/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747139308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descri